# --- local development only -------------------------------------------------
# DEV_LAN_ORIGIN: the host:port this machine is reachable at from a phone on the
# same network, e.g. 192.168.x.x. Read ONLY by `next dev`, via next.config.ts.
#
# Why it exists: without it Next blocks its own dev resources cross-origin, the
# page returns 200, and then no client island hydrates - a silent failure that
# looks like a stuck loading state. Leave it unset in production; it does
# nothing there. Never commit a real value.
DEV_LAN_ORIGIN=
